4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166"></path></svg> </li> </ol></div></div> <div class="review-header svelte-1b79zq6"><time class="date svelte-1b79zq6" datetime="2025-06-06T12:28:17.000Z">06/06/2025</time>  <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><span class="author svelte-1b79zq6">The story of wordle</span></span> </div></div></div> <div class="content svelte-1b79zq6">  <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-1b6lxg0"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-1b6lxg0" style="--lines: 5; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->It all started when I was in the 3rd grade . I was glued to a thesaurus. My glasses -the size of magnifying glasses, my efficiency - that of a snail. My homework - late. My sanity - all but gone. And then I graduated elementary school and got into middle school, met who I thought was the love of my life. We made a life together we went to theatre , the scene called for us , the lights drawn to us as our audience’ eyes , our eyes locked , as did our lips. Only to have our quiet candid life ripped from us because of graduation. The cruel advances of time and knowledge thrust us into different schools and not into each other. And yet again I who thought would never love again found it yet again. In the arms of my then lover. He made my flaws my perfections. My pride into his pride. My feelings , heard. He opened me to the life of lavishness and simplicity. The contrast or riches and poverty. Highs and lows. Happiness and  depravity. Hate and love. Truly establishing that all things have an equal and opposite. For our love ended with hate. As I opened a new chapter to my life. I went to college and entered the work force. Becoming a productive member of society, I strived for greatness and improve those around me. Learning from and  teaching those around me. Allowing for what is meant for me and achieving that what I set out for. Only to be ensnared by the hooked claws of a game such as wordle. The allure of which made me want to throw my phone but also clutch it for the need of wanting to clear each word with less than 3 attempts. Only to be be rewarded the word genius , some electronic confetti and the satisfaction of finishing a word only to face another word.TLDR: wordle is aight.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div>  </div></div>  <dialog data-testid="dialog" class="svelte-1p01z7" id="" aria-hidden="true"><div data-testid="content-modal" class="content-modal-container svelte-1ih6d3u" dir="auto"><div class="button-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><button data-testid="content-modal-close-button" class="close-button svelte-1ih6d3u" type="button" aria-label="Close"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 18 18" data-testid="content-modal-close-button-svg"><path d="M1.2 18C.6 18 0 17.5 0 16.8c0-.4.1-.6.4-.8l7-7-7-7c-.3-.2-.4-.5-.4-.8C0 .5.6 0 1.2 0c.3 0 .6.1.8.3l7 7 7-7c.2-.2.5-.3.8-.3.6 0 1.2.5 1.2 1.2 0 .3-.1.6-.4.8l-7 7 7 7c.2.2.4.5.4.8 0 .7-.6 1.2-1.2 1.2-.3 0-.6-.1-.8-.3l-7-7-7 7c-.2.1-.5.3-.8.3"></path></svg></button> </div> <div class="header-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><h1 data-testid="content-modal-title" class="title svelte-1ih6d3u">My vocabulary</h1> </div> <div class="content-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><div class="container svelte-1b79zq6 is-detail-view" aria-labelledby="review-12742386505-title" dir="ltr"><div class="header svelte-1b79zq6"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-1b79zq6"> <div style="display: contents; --fill-color:var(--systemOrange); --star-size:24px;"><ol