nd it yet again. In the arms of my then lover. He made my flaws my perfections. My pride into his pride. My feelings , heard. He opened me to the life of lavishness and simplicity. The contrast or riches and poverty. Highs and lows. Happiness and  depravity. Hate and love. Truly establishing that all things have an equal and opposite. For our love ended with hate. As I opened a new chapter to my life. I went to college and entered the work force. Becoming a productive member of society, I strived for greatness and improve those around me. Learning from and  teaching those around me. Allowing for what is meant for me and achieving that what I set out for. Only to be ensnared by the hooked claws of a game such as wordle. The allure of which made me want to throw my phone but also clutch it for the need of wanting to clear each word with less than 3 attempts. Only to be be rewarded the word genius , some electronic confetti and the satisfaction of finishing a word only to face another word.TLDR: wordle is aight.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --> </p></div> </div> </div> </dialog> </div></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-13b6ljx" data-test-id="shelf-grid-list-item-1" data-index="1" aria-hidden="true"><div class="svelte-13b6ljx"><div class="container svelte-1b79zq6" aria-labelledby="review-9296412806-title" dir="ltr"><div class="header svelte-1b79zq6"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-1b79zq6"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><h3 id="review-9296412806-title" class="title svelte-1b79zq6">“Ad Free” is a RIP OFF!!!</h3></span> </div> <div style="display: contents; --fill-color:var(--systemOrange); --star-size:12px;"><ol class="stars svelte-1fdd9o7" aria-label="1 Star"><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1