te-1b79zq6" datetime="2022-11-16T19:56:15.000Z">11/16/2022</time>  <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><span class="author svelte-1b79zq6">SarahSarah0920</span></span> </div></div></div> <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Okay so first of all it’s $6 for the ad free version of the game, but I’d been playing it every single day and I’d been going back to do daily puzzles from previous months, before I’d started playing. In order to do this, I was watching an ad to access the game, which was fine, but since ad free was so expensive compared to other apps, I figured purchasing would give me access to previous months puzzles without watching the apps— like other apps I’ve played have done. WRONG. Now I can’t watch an ad to access anything, AND it costs 150 coins PER PUZZLE. That means if I want to do the daily puzzle and the daily plus puzzle for a day I missed, it costs me 300 coins PER DAY!!! I messaged support because this seems really unfair and I would not have purchased the ad free version if I had known, and got no response. Deleted the app hoping I could reset the ads (a desperate attempt, I know) and instead it just erased all my progress and sent me back to the very start. No coins, no master league, not even all features unlocked. There was no way to restore my progress. Even my messages to support were gone. And also, in case you’re thinking you can just pay coins to do old puzzles and that it’ll let you watch an ad to to the next one when you run out of coins, it doesn’t. It tries to force you to buy coins. So you spend $6 for what you think will be a better version of the game, and instead you get slapped with a horrible pay to play system. Deleted the app.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --> <div class="developer-response-container svelte-1b79zq6"><div class="developer-response-header svelte-1b79zq6"><span class="developer-response-heading svelte-1b79zq6">Developer Response</span> <time class="date svelte-1b79zq6" datetime="2022-11-18T17:03:58.000Z">11/18/2022</time></div> <!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Hello! Thank you for the review! Would you mind sending your feedback to our support team? We'd love to hear from you! You can contact support in the game by tapping Gear Icon on the Main Menu, then tapping Help and Support&gt;Get in touch.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div></p></div> </div> </div> </dialog> </div></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-13b6ljx" data-test-id="shelf-grid-list-item-2" data-index="2" aria-hidden="true"><div class="svelte-13b6ljx"><div class="container svelte-1b79zq6" aria-labelledby="review-10525010032-title" dir="ltr"><div class="header svelte-1b79zq6"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-1b79zq6"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><h3 id="review-10525010032-title" class="title svelte-1b79zq6">Very good app</h3></span> </div> <div style="display: contents; --fill-color:var(--systemOrange); --star-size:12px;"><ol class="stars svelte-1fdd9o7" aria-label="5 Stars"><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166"></path></svg> </li><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c