4.166"></path></svg> </li> </ol></div></div> <div class="review-header svelte-1b79zq6"><time class="date svelte-1b79zq6" datetime="2023-10-28T16:23:57.000Z">10/28/2023</time>  <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><span class="author svelte-1b79zq6">Adalyn Welliver</span></span> </div></div></div> <div class="content svelte-1b79zq6">  <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-1b6lxg0"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-1b6lxg0" style="--lines: 5; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->This app keeps me entertained for hours. It is an amazing app and I really hope you will except this because it is one of the best apps that I’ve ever use that keeps me entertained for a very long time. I see all the reviews it’s perfect for someone who has patience if you don’t have patience please don’t get this because you will not like this, so if you really want this game it’s a very wonderful game you do not have to pay anything there’s a daily wordle a spelling bee and more it is a bunch of fun and you can do it with as many people as you like it is free to download and it is a perfect game for people who have a lot of smartness and patience and anyway I love this game I had it before and I deleted it but then I got it back because I’m like I am bored. How about we try this game again so I think that you should definitely and if you’re like on a long car ride, this is perfect to entertain you and maybe your family to have a lot of fun car ride and it depends. Where are you going? You can like get a bunch of different like categories so like you can get a tropical category if you’re going to like Hawaii and If you are  like going to like a tropical area. You can get the tropical vibes thing and go into like a Halloween parade. Very far away you can get the Halloween mode it has a bunch of features. and someone who loves anything or any words are any will love this game and say you’re on the road this game has gotten you covered. I mean it does have some payments if you want to like get more coins but you can also get like 50 coins by watching an ad and if you don’t want any, and you have to buy that sorry i connot control that I’m sorry I can’t control it but I just tried to give you guys are gonna love you you guys can get this game whoever only owns this game kissing noises dead perfect.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div>  </div></div>  <dialog data-testid="dialog" class="svelte-1p01z7" id="" aria-hidden="true"><div data-testid="content-modal" class="content-modal-container svelte-1ih6d3u" dir="auto"><div class="button-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><button data-testid="content-modal-close-button" class="close-button svelte-1ih6d3u" type="button" aria-label="Close"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 18 18" data-testid="content-modal-close-button-svg"><path d="M1.2 18C.6 18 0 17.5 0 16.8c0-.4.1-.6.4-.8l7-7-7-7c-.3-.2-.4-.5-.4-.8C0 .5.6 0 1.2 0c.3 0 .6.1.8.3l7 7 7-7c.2-.2.5-.3.8-.3.6 0 1.2.5 1.2 1.2 0 .3-.1.6-.4.8l-7 7 7 7c.2.2.4.5.4.8 0 .7-.6 1.2-1.2 1.2-.3 0-.6-.1-.8-.3l-7-7-7 7c-.2.1-.5.3-.8.3"></path></svg></button> </div> <div class="header-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><h1 data-testid="content-modal-title" class="title svelte-1ih6d3u">Very good app</h1> </div> <div class="content-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><div class="container svelte-1b79zq6 is-detail-view" aria-labelledby="review-10525010032-title" dir="ltr"><div class="header svelte-1b79zq6"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-1b79zq6"> <div style="display: contents; --fill-color:var(--systemOrange); --star-size:24px;"><ol class="stars svelte-1fdd9o7" aria-label="5 Stars"><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.