Test your brain & solve crime","ageRating":"13+","productDescription":"Clue Master: Solve Crimes, Uncover Secrets, and Find the Criminal!\n\nEnter the gripping world of Clue Master, a unique blend of brain games and logic puzzles where your deduction skills are put to the ultimate test. Dive into challenging mysteries to identify criminals, protect the innocent, and unravel complex webs of romance, family, and friendship entangled with betrayal. This is the perfect brain game for adults looking to challenge their IQ and enjoy cryptic crosswords, word puzzles, and mystery games all in one!\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Immersive Logic Puzzles: Each level presents unique clues, requiring sharp logic and deduction skills to piece together. Identify criminals, clear the innocent, and make tough calls that could save lives.\n  \n- Betrayal and Loyalty: Navigate puzzles where personal relationships play a central role—discover secrets of romance and betrayal, unravel tangled family trees, and uncover friends who deceive.\n\n- Heart-Pounding Mysteries: Engage in suspense-filled scenarios with hidden hints that reveal not only the culprit but also motives of love, envy, and revenge, perfect for fans of detective games and clue games.\n\n- Strategic Clue Gathering: Read clues carefully, pick up on subtle details, and think critically to solve each mystery. Whether you’re into problem-solving or riddles, one wrong move could lead to the wrong suspect or missed danger.\n\n- Intense Crime-Solving Missions: Track down cunning criminals, gather evidence, and make careful decisions to bring them to justice. Each solved case brings you closer to becoming a master detective!\n\n- Diverse Gameplay: With gameplay inspired by IQ tests, cross logic, and crypto brain puzzles, you’ll enjoy puzzles with increasing complexity that keep you guessing and thinking deeply.\n\n- Captivating Storyline & Characters: Experience the thrill of finding \"the one\" who betrayed, dealing with the consequences, and exploring character stories woven with gossip, secrets, and romance.\n\nReady to solve the toughest cases, uncover hidden betrayals, and use your logic to save lives? Download Clue Master now and start your journey with cryptograms, memory games for adults, and word puzzles designed to challenge your brain!\n\nAre you prepared to face the truth? Enter Clue Master and discover the secrets that lie beneath!\n\nVisit https://lionstudios.cc/contact-us/ if you have any feedback, need help on beating a level, or have any awesome ideas you would like to see in the game!\n\nFrom the Studio that brought you Hexa Sort, Family Tree, Wordle!, Match 3D, and many, many more!\n\nFollow us to get news and updates on our other Award-Winning titles:  \nhttps://lionstudios.cc/  \nFacebook.com/LionStudios.cc  \nInstagram.com/LionStudioscc  \nTwitter.com/LionStudiosCC  \nYoutube.com/c/LionStudiosCC","rating":4.6,"ratingCount":"28K","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=6608973267&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=883351184"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","idType":"its_id","id":"6608973267"},{"locationPosition":10,"locationType":"lockup","name":"Clue Master - Logic Puzzles","idType":"its_id","id":"6608973267"},{"locationPosition":11,"locationType":"swoosh","name":"More by Lion Studios Plus","idType":"sequential","id":"25"}],"jet_adamId":"6608973267","eventType":"click","targetType":"button","targetId":"6608973267","platformContext":"iphone","alt_ab2_data":"[]"},"includingFields":["impressionsSnapshot","pageFields","contentRestrictionReasons","appState"],"excludingFields":["amsMetricsID"],"topic":"xp_amp_appstore_unidentified","shouldFlush":false}],"custom":{"jet_adamId":"6608973267"}},"$kind":"OfferAction","actionClass":"OfferAction","adamId":"6608973267","purchaseConfiguration":{"$kind":"Purchase