operTagline":"Bounce, Aim & Escape the Walls","ageRating":"13+","productDescription":"Bounce, aim, and escape in Walls—a fast-paced, physics-based puzzle game where precision is everything! Hit the walls just the right number of times to unlock the exit, but be careful—one extra bounce and you lose.\n\nMASTER THOUSANDS UNIQUE PUZZLE LEVELS!\n\nChallenge your timing, reflexes, and strategic thinking with thousands handcrafted levels designed to test your skills. Can you find the perfect angle and complete every stage?\n\nCLASSIC MODE – THE ULTIMATE SKILL TEST!\n\nThink you’ve mastered the game? Classic Mode raises the stakes—each time you score, the required bounces increase. The longer you last, the harder it gets!\n\nCOMPETE ON THE GLOBAL LEADERBOARD!\n\nPrecision matters—launch the ball, hit your target, and climb the rankings! Compete against players worldwide and prove you're the best.\n\nWHY PLAYERS LOVE WALLS:\n\n• Fast, addictive gameplay – Easy to learn, hard to master!\n• Skill-based challenges – Reflexes, precision, and timing matter.\n• Competitive Leaderboards – Play, improve, and rank up.\n• Classic arcade mechanics – A modern take on physics-based puzzles.\n\n\nDownload Walls today and put your precision to the test!\n","rating":4.4,"ratingCount":"2.1K","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=1547499394&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=888173342"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"1547499394"},{"locationPosition":1,"locationType":"lockup","name":"Walls - Launch The Ball Game","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"1547499394"},{"locationPosition":12,"locationType":"similarIte