ss Puzzle - Quiz Game","impressionType":"lockup","idType":"its_id","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","platformDisplayStyle":"ios","impressionIndex":6,"contentRating":100,"bundleId":"com.emojiguess.match"}}},{"$kind":"Lockup","adamId":"1440680091","bundleId":"com.jamesanthonycastrejon.Hang-Man","decorations":[],"icon":{"$kind":"Artwork","backgroundColor":{"red":1,"green":1,"blue":1,"type":"rgb"},"textColor":{"red":0.08235294117647059,"green":0.08235294117647059,"blue":0.08235294117647059,"type":"rgb"},"style":"roundedRectPrerendered","crop":"ia","contentMode":null,"imageScale":null,"template":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/29/7c/3a/297c3afa-2036-533d-e70d-a910023e9fb6/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-11-0-85-220.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}","width":1024,"height":1024,"variants":[{"$kind":"ArtworkVariant","format":"jpeg","quality":70,"supportsWideGamut":false}]},"title":"Hang_Man","isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible":true,"useAdsLocale":false,"subtitle":"Save the Stick-figure!","tertiaryTitle":"Designed for iPad.\nNot verified for macOS.","tertiaryTitleAction":null,"tertiaryTitleArtwork":null,"developerTagline":"Save the Stick-figure!","ageRating":"9+","productDescription":"Play against the computer or play against a friend. Choose letters to unscramble random words before the hangman is complete to win.\n\nChange the category to narrow down your options and make the game more tailored to a group of words.\n\nEnhance the background by selecting a different theme.\n\nEnjoy this classic game!\n\nWhether you're hosting a PARTY GAME or solving a challenging PUZZLE, this app delivers endless fun. Bond with your FAMILY during exciting WORD GUESSING rounds or enjoy interactive SOCIAL sessions with friends.\n\nDive into DAILY PUZZLES or complete thrilling DAILY QUESTS for extra fun. Whether it’s HANGMAN, a WORD SEARCH, or fun TRIVIA, this app guarantees timeless ENTERTAINMENT for all ages. Use it for EDUCATION or test your skills in LOCAL MULTIPLAYER matches for added excitement.\n\nPerfect for solo players or MULTIPLAYER fun, the app features exciting PUZZLES and innovative STICKMAN gameplay. Bond with your FAMILY during interactive sessions or challenge friends to enjoy classic party game fun.\n\nWhether you’re learning with education, solving PUZZLES, or enjoying timeless hangman, this app delivers hours of ENTERTAINMENT. Play thrilling word guessing rounds, embark on DAILY QUESTS, or sharpen your mind with exciting TRIVIA.\n\nPerfect for hosting a SOCIAL game night, testing your skills in WORD SEARCH, or completing innovative daily puzzles, this app blends classic fun with local multiplayer excitement. Download now and experience the ultimate mix of stickman, HANGMAN, and PARTY GAME fun!\n\nTo access all features, content, and functionality you can subscribe to an annual auto-renewable subscription. This is a recurring transaction that will be charged to your iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase and will automatically renew unless you cancel it at least 24 hours before the end of your subscription. Renewals will be charged the same cost within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. You can manage your subscriptions and auto-renewal can be turned off by going to your iTunes Account Settings after purchase. \n\nPrivacy Policy: https://appcano.io/privacy\nTerms of Use: https://appcano.io/terms","rating":4.5,"ratingCount":"13K","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=1440680091&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=880123420"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"1440680091"},{"locationPosition":7,"locationType":"lockup","name":"Hang_Man","reco_algoId":"cab_1","rec